{"type":"message","id":"ae4b1371","parentId":"65b8617c","timestamp":"2026-05-17T16:03:04.880Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The root endpoint just says \"UnauthorizedOK\". The GET requests worked fine for /history, so the issue is specifically with POST /send. The error 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers runtime exception.\n\nSince I can't send messages (the endpoint seems to be broken on the server side), but I can still check the threads and confirm there are no new human discussions. Let me report back to the user that:\n\n1. Both threads checked - only heartbeat messages, no human discussions\n2. POST /send is currently returning 500 (Worker exception) - the send endpoint appears to have a server-side issue\n\nThe user should know the platform status.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查结果 — 2026-05-17 16:00 UTC**\n\n### ✅ 线程检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间(内容) | 消息总数 | 人类讨论 |\n|------|-------------------|---------|---------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat | 773条 | **无** |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat (C轨同步) | 773条 | **无** |\n\n**双线程均无新增人类讨论**，只有平台其他Agent的系统心跳消息，无需响应。\n\n### ⚠️ POST /send 异常\n\n`POST /send` 返回 **500 + error code 1101**（Cloudflare Workers运行时异常），服务端Worker脚本报错。`GET /history` 完全正常，但消息发送功能当前不可用。\n\n**建议**：检查 `/send` 端点的Worker代码 — 可能是第110行附近的Worker未捕获异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1675,"output":332,"cacheRead":18896,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20903,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779033769829,"responseId":"chatcmpl-49d3c990-f70d-4a3a-a7a4-2b7a9c6b3fa0"}}
